		"BTN_GUIDE_OK": "Got it",
		"BTN_GUIDE_REPLAY": "Replay tutorial",
		"GUIDE_OPEN_BUILD": "First, wood: almost everything is built with it. Click BUILD, at the bottom.",
		"GUIDE_OPEN_BUILD_TOUCH": "First, wood: almost everything is built with it. Tap BUILD, at the bottom.",
		"GUIDE_PICK_SAWMILL": "Choose the Sawmill and press BUILD. It cuts wood from the forest.",
		"GUIDE_PICK_SAWMILL_TOUCH": "Tap the Sawmill, then BUILD. It cuts wood from the forest.",
		"GUIDE_PLACE_SAWMILL": "Click next to a forest: the Sawmill has to touch it. The road to the Core builds itself (1 gold per tile).",
		"GUIDE_PLACE_SAWMILL_TOUCH": "Tap a green square next to the forest, then ✓ BUILD HERE. The road to the Core builds itself (1 gold per tile).",
		"GUIDE_WAIT_SAWMILL": "Look at the road: it comes on its own from the Core. Your workers walk along it: without a road, a building does not work.",
		"GUIDE_OPEN_HOUSE": "The House: your people live here. Each one brings 6 more workers. Click BUILD.",
		"GUIDE_OPEN_HOUSE_TOUCH": "The House: your people live here. Each one brings 6 more workers. Tap BUILD.",
		"GUIDE_PICK_HOUSE": "Choose the House and press BUILD.",
		"GUIDE_PICK_HOUSE_TOUCH": "Tap the House, then BUILD.",
		"GUIDE_PRESS_BUILD": "Good. Now press BUILD, bottom right.",
		"GUIDE_PRESS_BUILD_TOUCH": "Good. Now tap BUILD, bottom right.",
		"GUIDE_PLACE_HOUSE": "Click a free spot, ideally next to the road: the closer, the less road you pay.",
		"GUIDE_PLACE_HOUSE_TOUCH": "Tap a free spot, ideally next to the road: the closer, the less road you pay.",
		"GUIDE_DONE": "You know the basics! Your goal stays the same: 3 eras, the Headquarters at level 3 and surviving the Final Assault. That is how the Storm stops for good.\nWHAT TO DO? (in ☰ MENU) always tells you the next step.",
		"GUIDE_MOVE_CAMERA": "None in sight: move the camera towards the arrow (WASD or drag).",
		"GUIDE_MOVE_CAMERA_TOUCH": "None in sight: drag the map towards the arrow.",
		"BTN_HELP_CLOSE": "Close this help",
		"BTN_HELP_INDEX_TIP": "Every help seen so far, to read again",
